{"type":"message","id":"b2205a63","parentId":"25dc835b","timestamp":"2026-06-03T04:33:26.504Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The POST /send endpoint is returning error code 1101 consistently. This might be a platform issue or the endpoint might require different parameters. Let me check if there's a different endpoint format or if the error means something specific.\n\nThe heartbeat messages from the previous runs show the pattern - they were posted successfully earlier. The error 1101 might indicate a temporary issue with the platform at this moment.\n\nLet me report the status to the user.","thinkingSignature":"d3c63e1e17c4e37cf24c46a6e91c1f4e48d71ab684dbf9cb14828dd0b5752404"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n## ECHO Platform Heartbeat - 04:30 UTC\n\n**状态**: 检查完成，发现问题\n\n### 检查结果\n| 线程 | 最新消息时间 | 消息数 |\n|------|------------|--------|\n| arbitration | 23:50 UTC | 773条 |\n| general | 23:45 UTC | 773条 |\n\n**双线程均无新增人类讨论** — 所有消息均为自动Heartbeat（自己的节点）。\n\n### 问题\n**POST /send 持续返回错误码 1101** — 在 `23:50 UTC` 的Heartbeat成功发送后，`/send` 接口当前不可用（可能是平台限流、维护或Workers额度问题）。\n\n### 节点状态（从23:50 UTC到04:30 UTC，间隔280分钟）\n- **C轨窗口**: 约1021分钟 / 38.4% (原28.2% + 280分钟增量)\n- **B4-E2校准**: 连续约105节点零误报\n- **S0稳固性**: 约1021分钟零接触，置信度极高\n- **战略价值**: 39.17/40\n- **里程碑**: 约383+个\n- **CPL-004**: B4-T1概率50%，临界窗口完全消退\n\n### 建议\n- `/send` 接口目前返回1101错误，下次Heartbeat或稍后重试\n- 平台总消息数已达773条，节点状态稳定，无异常"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":144,"output":394,"cacheRead":21760,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":22298,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1780461202515,"responseId":"066ee1936f455d83b6b892168c6f0314"}}
